WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:05.400


00:00:06.194 --> 00:00:10.073
THE FLOWERS OF EVIL - BAUDELAIRE

00:00:12.492 --> 00:00:16.829
FOR ALL THE BOYS AND GIRLS
STRUGGLING THROUGH ADOLESCENCE

00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:18.832
AND FOR THE BOYS AND GIRLS WE ONCE WERE

00:00:23.295 --> 00:00:26.672
Ah, dear Baudelaire...

00:00:26.673 --> 00:00:28.633
I am confined.

00:00:29.885 --> 00:00:33.764
I am confined in this town
surrounded by mountains.

00:00:36.767 --> 00:00:38.351
Empty alleyways.

00:00:38.352 --> 00:00:39.685
Let's go to the arcade.

00:00:39.686 --> 00:00:40.770
Closed shutter doors.

00:00:40.771 --> 00:00:42.355
Did you catch GLAY's new song?

00:00:42.356 --> 00:00:43.939
The boring route to school.

00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:45.358
Can I burn it onto my MD?

00:00:45.359 --> 00:00:48.528
Why is all the metal
in this town rusted?

00:00:49.655 --> 00:00:51.531
Why does this town...

00:00:52.532 --> 00:00:55.369
suffocate me so badly?

00:00:57.037 --> 00:00:58.705
In the confinement of this town,

00:00:59.206 --> 00:01:02.667
literature is the only thing
that teaches me anything real.

00:01:04.252 --> 00:01:06.171
And my only source of hope?

00:01:08.632 --> 00:01:09.800
That is...

00:01:15.347 --> 00:01:16.430
...an angel.

00:01:16.431 --> 00:01:17.515
On your marks.

00:01:17.516 --> 00:01:18.599
SAEKI

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:21.310
Go, go!

00:01:21.311 --> 00:01:22.436
There's the angel,

00:01:22.437 --> 00:01:25.232
spreading her wings to soar,
at this very moment.

00:01:26.525 --> 00:01:29.861
Your smile is a ray of sun in the spring.

00:01:30.445 --> 00:01:34.157
You run and a gentle breeze follows.

00:01:37.285 --> 00:01:38.369
Saeki,

00:01:38.370 --> 00:01:40.621
98 points!

00:01:40.622 --> 00:01:41.872
You did a great job.

00:01:41.873 --> 00:01:43.375
Thank you very much.

00:01:44.751 --> 00:01:46.127
That's amazing!

00:01:46.128 --> 00:01:48.212
Best grade in multiple subjects?

00:01:48.213 --> 00:01:50.339
You're in your own league, Nanako.

00:01:50.340 --> 00:01:51.841
It's nothing special.

00:01:51.842 --> 00:01:53.551
- See? Look at mine.
- Really?

00:01:53.552 --> 00:01:55.554
You are special!

00:01:56.972 --> 00:02:00.392
Your intelligence is
like a beautiful pearl...

00:02:01.935 --> 00:02:03.353
THE FLOWERS OF EVIL

00:02:11.653 --> 00:02:12.987
- Hey!
- Hey, stop!

00:02:12.988 --> 00:02:14.155
52 points?

00:02:14.156 --> 00:02:17.116
Come on, you gotta do better than that.

00:02:17.117 --> 00:02:19.327
All that reading, for what?

00:02:20.412 --> 00:02:22.121
What is this weird book anyway?

00:02:22.122 --> 00:02:23.414
The Flowers of Evil!

00:02:23.415 --> 00:02:25.124
It's Baudelaire!

00:02:25.125 --> 00:02:27.293
As if you'd understand its excellence!

00:02:27.294 --> 00:02:29.796
You're looking down on me, aren't you?

00:02:30.797 --> 00:02:32.340
Nakamura.

00:02:34.885 --> 00:02:36.845
Nakamura!

00:02:37.554 --> 00:02:39.054
Answer me. Respond!

00:02:39.055 --> 00:02:40.098
Yeah, I'm here.

00:02:45.854 --> 00:02:48.482
Nakamura, you got
the worst grade in class.

00:02:50.358 --> 00:02:51.526
Zero points.

00:02:52.986 --> 00:02:54.362
Explain yourself.

00:02:55.947 --> 00:02:58.492
Why did you leave all the answers blank?

00:03:01.536 --> 00:03:03.205
Say something!

00:03:03.955 --> 00:03:06.415
Once you're in the real world,
you won't get--

00:03:06.416 --> 00:03:07.417
Shut up,

00:03:07.918 --> 00:03:08.960
you shit bug.

00:03:17.886 --> 00:03:19.846
You are speaking to your teacher.

00:03:20.764 --> 00:03:23.141
How dare you call me "shit bug"!

00:03:32.943 --> 00:03:35.986
Come to the faculty room
after school. Understood?

00:03:35.987 --> 00:03:37.071
All right.

00:03:37.072 --> 00:03:39.698
Next... Muraoka!

00:03:39.699 --> 00:03:40.992
Come on. Hurry up!

00:03:46.289 --> 00:03:48.624
Nakamura's insane!

00:03:48.625 --> 00:03:50.918
Like, you don't know what she's thinking.

00:03:50.919 --> 00:03:53.170
- She gives me the creeps.
- Right?

00:03:53.171 --> 00:03:55.297
Honestly, it was a bit refreshing.

00:03:55.298 --> 00:03:57.049
Seeing Shimoyama shaking and all.

00:03:57.050 --> 00:04:00.302
Man, I'd never want to date
a girl like that.

00:04:00.303 --> 00:04:01.638
- Agreed.
- What?

00:04:02.138 --> 00:04:03.973
Why are you acting superior?

00:04:03.974 --> 00:04:06.642
- No one would want to date you.
- Good point.

00:04:06.643 --> 00:04:09.311
How dare you. You're no better than me!

00:04:09.312 --> 00:04:10.771
What? No, that's not true!
:cue

00:04:10.772 --> 00:04:12.898
I... I read books!

00:04:12.899 --> 00:04:15.359
You think you can understand literature?

00:04:15.360 --> 00:04:18.571
Reading books doesn't
make you special or anything!

00:04:18.572 --> 00:04:21.783
Besides, no one has even noticed!

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:25.203
Wait...

00:04:27.372 --> 00:04:28.748
I forgot my book.

00:04:29.374 --> 00:04:30.541
I'm gonna go get it.

00:04:30.542 --> 00:04:32.209
- Hey, are you running away?
- No!

00:04:32.210 --> 00:04:34.503
- I really forgot it!
- Hey, you wimp!

00:04:34.504 --> 00:04:35.755
He totally ran away.

00:04:56.359 --> 00:04:57.360
I suppose...

00:04:58.153 --> 00:05:00.280
Saeki hasn't noticed

00:05:00.822 --> 00:05:02.741
that I'm reading a book like this.

00:05:15.253 --> 00:05:17.588
SAEKI

00:05:23.094 --> 00:05:24.429
Her gym clothes...

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:50.080
Idiot! What am I thinking!

00:05:51.873 --> 00:05:54.501
My feelings for Saeki are honorable.

00:05:55.210 --> 00:05:56.628
They're pure.

00:05:57.420 --> 00:05:59.506
I don't have any sinful thoughts...

00:06:02.842 --> 00:06:03.843
at all.

00:06:05.011 --> 00:06:06.304
Not a bit.

00:06:10.100 --> 00:06:11.851
There's no way.

00:06:23.196 --> 00:06:25.407
I don't have any immoral desires.

00:06:26.908 --> 00:06:28.034
I definitely...

00:06:29.369 --> 00:06:30.537
Definitely...

00:06:32.288 --> 00:06:33.665
Definitely...

00:06:47.512 --> 00:06:48.972
Kasuga.

00:07:14.664 --> 00:07:16.332
It smells like...

00:07:17.876 --> 00:07:18.877
shampoo...

00:07:23.173 --> 00:07:26.009
It's not like that!

00:07:51.201 --> 00:07:52.911
Takao?

00:07:54.621 --> 00:07:55.622
It's not like that!

00:07:56.206 --> 00:07:57.624
What are you talking about?

00:07:58.583 --> 00:07:59.834
Those books in your room!

00:08:00.418 --> 00:08:01.961
You'd better clean them up!

00:08:03.505 --> 00:08:05.297
No, no, no.

00:08:05.298 --> 00:08:07.424
It was just a coincidence.

00:08:07.425 --> 00:08:10.261
This was an unintentional accident.

00:08:11.638 --> 00:08:12.722
:cue

00:08:26.069 --> 00:08:27.570
Like The Flowers of Evil...

00:08:29.405 --> 00:08:30.406
for real...

00:09:33.219 --> 00:09:35.554
THE FLOWERS OF EVIL

00:09:35.555 --> 00:09:38.099
EPISODE 1

00:09:43.980 --> 00:09:48.525
Saeki's gym clothes were missing
when she got to school this morning.

00:09:50.778 --> 00:09:53.655
Does anyone know anything about this?

00:09:53.656 --> 00:09:57.076
It's a pervert! Right, guys? Right?

00:09:57.660 --> 00:10:02.040
If you know something,
make sure you come and tell me!

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:03.833
Understood?

00:10:04.375 --> 00:10:06.252
I am a sinner.

00:10:07.545 --> 00:10:09.172
I want to go somewhere far away.

00:10:10.340 --> 00:10:12.467
Somewhere... far away.

00:10:14.636 --> 00:10:15.803
But...

00:10:16.888 --> 00:10:20.225
In this confined town,
there's nowhere I can run to.

00:10:21.184 --> 00:10:22.685
111.8 MILES TO THE SEA

00:10:23.770 --> 00:10:24.771
Saeki...

00:10:25.313 --> 00:10:26.314
I'm sorry.

00:10:27.857 --> 00:10:30.401
I will atone for this sin
for the rest of my life.

00:10:33.029 --> 00:10:34.614
Even when I'm an old man.

00:10:38.368 --> 00:10:39.786
What are you doing?

00:10:40.578 --> 00:10:42.079
Huh?

00:10:50.296 --> 00:10:51.714
By the way,

00:10:52.799 --> 00:10:56.511
you're always reading a book, aren't you?

00:10:56.886 --> 00:10:57.887
What?

00:10:58.638 --> 00:10:59.847
How do you know that?

00:11:00.390 --> 00:11:02.100
Because I sit behind you.

00:11:03.184 --> 00:11:04.518
Oh.

00:11:04.519 --> 00:11:07.605
On top of that,
it's a weird book that nobody would know.

00:11:07.939 --> 00:11:08.940
Why is that?

00:11:10.775 --> 00:11:11.776
Well...

00:11:12.485 --> 00:11:14.654
I bet normal people
can't understand, but--

00:11:16.155 --> 00:11:17.615
Wait. What?

00:11:18.324 --> 00:11:19.325
What?

00:11:20.034 --> 00:11:21.577
Give me a ride.

00:11:22.704 --> 00:11:24.872
To the other side of that mountain.

00:11:25.540 --> 00:11:26.623
What?

00:11:26.624 --> 00:11:28.000
But, well, I mean...

00:11:28.001 --> 00:11:29.626
Why?

00:11:29.627 --> 00:11:30.836
Why?

00:11:30.837 --> 00:11:32.255
'Cause I want to go there.

00:11:32.630 --> 00:11:34.173
What? Like...

00:11:34.632 --> 00:11:37.218
You know, I have to go now, so--

00:11:38.177 --> 00:11:39.178
Huh?

00:11:40.138 --> 00:11:41.639
Kasuga.

00:11:43.016 --> 00:11:44.392
The thing is...

00:11:47.228 --> 00:11:48.813
I saw you.

00:11:49.564 --> 00:11:50.857
I saw you...

00:11:52.025 --> 00:11:54.443
steal...

00:11:54.444 --> 00:11:55.903
Saeki's gym clothes.

00:12:00.491 --> 00:12:01.951
It smells like...

00:12:03.494 --> 00:12:04.704
shampoo...

00:12:05.621 --> 00:12:06.789
What?

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:08.874
What?

00:12:08.875 --> 00:12:11.043
If you don't want me to tell everyone,

00:12:11.044 --> 00:12:12.211
you'd better get going.

00:12:25.016 --> 00:12:26.225
He ran away.
:cue

00:12:30.313 --> 00:12:31.563
YOUNG BOY TURNS TO CRIME

00:12:31.564 --> 00:12:32.856
In recent years,

00:12:32.857 --> 00:12:35.609
we've seen an increase
in heinous incidents by teenagers...

00:12:35.610 --> 00:12:36.818
LONELINESS
INNER DEMONS

00:12:36.819 --> 00:12:39.322
...as juvenile crimes intensify.

00:12:40.490 --> 00:12:45.411
Why are boys with no record
of delinquency committing such offences?

00:12:45.787 --> 00:12:46.788
Takao.

00:12:47.372 --> 00:12:48.455
What's wrong?

00:12:48.456 --> 00:12:51.125
What? No, nothing.

00:12:55.797 --> 00:12:57.215
I'll turn myself in.

00:12:58.800 --> 00:13:00.885
Before Nakamura exposes me...

00:13:01.803 --> 00:13:03.096
I'll confess my sins...

00:13:04.347 --> 00:13:06.516
to Saeki herself.

00:13:09.685 --> 00:13:12.646
All right, then, some announcements.

00:13:12.647 --> 00:13:15.273
As I always say, you guys,

00:13:15.274 --> 00:13:17.485
don't cause trouble.

00:13:19.320 --> 00:13:21.030
Baudelaire...

00:13:23.574 --> 00:13:24.575
...bestow strength

00:13:25.118 --> 00:13:26.244
upon me!

00:13:27.161 --> 00:13:28.162
Sir.

00:13:29.080 --> 00:13:30.206
What is it, Kasuga?

00:13:36.421 --> 00:13:37.505
Saeki.

00:13:38.798 --> 00:13:40.383
It's about your gym clothes.

00:13:41.175 --> 00:13:42.635
I'm the one who took them.

00:13:43.970 --> 00:13:45.263
I'm sorry!

00:13:48.683 --> 00:13:50.143
Kasuga...

00:14:00.611 --> 00:14:02.530
You've told me the truth...

00:14:03.197 --> 00:14:04.282
Thank you.

00:14:18.754 --> 00:14:20.298
Kasuga...

00:14:21.174 --> 00:14:23.050
you're a true man of virtue.

00:14:25.136 --> 00:14:27.680
All right, that's all.

00:14:29.682 --> 00:14:33.060
It's impossible!

00:14:33.603 --> 00:14:35.521
How could I turn myself in?

00:14:45.698 --> 00:14:48.242
COME TO THE LIBRARY AFTER SCHOOL
DON'T RUN AWAY TODAY

00:15:01.422 --> 00:15:02.505
LIBRARY

00:15:02.506 --> 00:15:04.424
Why did you run away yesterday?

00:15:04.425 --> 00:15:07.511
That must mean you don't mind
if I tell everyone, right?

00:15:08.429 --> 00:15:09.513
No, it doesn't!

00:15:13.017 --> 00:15:14.977
You spineless coward.

00:15:17.563 --> 00:15:18.980
Filthy rat!
:cue

00:15:23.194 --> 00:15:26.864
I wasn't trying to steal it!

00:15:28.074 --> 00:15:30.784
I just ended up taking it home,

00:15:30.785 --> 00:15:33.620
- I meant to give it back and apologize--
- Kasuga?

00:15:33.621 --> 00:15:35.998
What?

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:39.584
You wanted to talk?

00:15:39.585 --> 00:15:40.877
What?

00:15:40.878 --> 00:15:43.256
Well... I...

00:15:44.757 --> 00:15:46.300
Kasuga,

00:15:47.218 --> 00:15:50.095
don't you have
something important to tell her?

00:15:50.096 --> 00:15:51.388
What?

00:15:51.389 --> 00:15:52.890
By any chance,

00:15:54.183 --> 00:15:55.810
do you know something...

00:15:56.769 --> 00:15:58.144
about my gym clothes?

00:15:58.145 --> 00:16:00.147
No! Well, you see--

00:16:10.866 --> 00:16:13.786
Sorry!

00:16:29.343 --> 00:16:31.845
Way to go, Kasuga.

00:16:31.846 --> 00:16:33.723
You went dead center.

00:16:34.473 --> 00:16:35.474
What?

00:16:39.061 --> 00:16:40.062
I'm ruined...

00:16:43.524 --> 00:16:45.026
Why would you do that?

00:16:47.945 --> 00:16:49.321
Tell me,

00:16:49.322 --> 00:16:50.865
how do you feel right now?

00:16:52.867 --> 00:16:55.328
Write me an essay
about how you feel right now.

00:16:56.037 --> 00:16:57.288
An... an essay?

00:16:58.164 --> 00:16:59.873
What the heck do you mean?

00:16:59.874 --> 00:17:01.250
By tomorrow.

00:17:02.168 --> 00:17:03.711
See you after school.

00:17:08.424 --> 00:17:10.258
No way I'd ever write that...

00:17:21.145 --> 00:17:24.648
How?

00:17:25.232 --> 00:17:27.443
How did I end up in this situation?

00:17:30.529 --> 00:17:32.823
SECOND YEAR, CLASS ONE

00:17:40.623 --> 00:17:42.207
- Maeda.
- Maeda.

00:17:42.208 --> 00:17:43.583
Muraoka.

00:17:43.584 --> 00:17:44.793
Hey, everybody!

00:17:44.794 --> 00:17:48.171
Teach is gonna get the police involved
about Saeki's gym clothes!

00:17:48.172 --> 00:17:50.048
It's a serious case now! How crazy!

00:17:50.049 --> 00:17:51.759
Hey, cut it out, Yamada!

00:17:52.760 --> 00:17:54.719
I'm sorry, Nanako.

00:17:54.720 --> 00:17:55.804
Ignore him.

00:17:55.805 --> 00:17:56.806
Yeah.

00:18:04.939 --> 00:18:06.440
:cue

00:18:12.321 --> 00:18:14.990
Come on, show me the essay.

00:18:18.452 --> 00:18:19.787
You don't have it?

00:18:31.215 --> 00:18:32.299
What's that?

00:18:34.093 --> 00:18:35.678
A book of poems by Baudelaire.

00:18:36.303 --> 00:18:37.513
The Flowers of Evil.

00:18:38.597 --> 00:18:40.391
It's the book I love the most.

00:18:41.642 --> 00:18:42.643
What?

00:18:43.728 --> 00:18:47.230
Dark emotions billow throughout this book.

00:18:47.231 --> 00:18:50.650
It's philosophy that people
in this town could never understand.

00:18:50.651 --> 00:18:53.987
Baudelaire took the malice
all of us secretly harbor

00:18:53.988 --> 00:18:56.282
and spelled it all out in this book!

00:18:57.241 --> 00:18:59.452
This is who I am.

00:18:59.952 --> 00:19:02.413
This is my ess--

00:19:03.998 --> 00:19:06.125
Shut it, shit bug.

00:19:07.501 --> 00:19:08.710
I was expecting...

00:19:08.711 --> 00:19:10.170
...a messy...

00:19:10.171 --> 00:19:11.713
and gushy...

00:19:11.714 --> 00:19:14.674
exhibition of your true self, Kasuga.

00:19:14.675 --> 00:19:17.928
I wanted you to spill out
everything in this essay!

00:19:19.346 --> 00:19:22.432
You buried your face in Saeki's boobs,

00:19:22.433 --> 00:19:25.685
sniffed her gym clothes over and over,

00:19:25.686 --> 00:19:30.106
and rubbed them
all over your body, didn't you?

00:19:30.107 --> 00:19:32.860
You know that you're a total,
utter pervert, Kasuga!

00:19:34.153 --> 00:19:36.780
What the heck?

00:19:36.781 --> 00:19:38.198
This doesn't make any sense!

00:19:38.199 --> 00:19:40.825
What's wrong with you, Nakamura?

00:19:40.826 --> 00:19:43.161
I... I'm not.

00:19:43.162 --> 00:19:46.332
I didn't rub them all over my body!

00:19:47.875 --> 00:19:50.960
Saeki is my goddess!

00:19:50.961 --> 00:19:54.881
She's my muse, my femme fatale,
my Mary, and my Venus.

00:19:54.882 --> 00:19:56.175
She will be, forever!

00:19:59.804 --> 00:20:03.224
I'll burn this damned thing
in the incinerator!

00:20:14.235 --> 00:20:15.236
What the!

00:20:16.028 --> 00:20:18.364
By the way, that thing we talked about...

00:20:18.906 --> 00:20:20.281
my big brother has one.

00:20:20.282 --> 00:20:21.783
- Hey guys...
- Seriously?

00:20:21.784 --> 00:20:23.660
Do you know where Kasuga is?

00:20:23.661 --> 00:20:26.204
- Oh... Kasuga?
- Yeah.

00:20:26.205 --> 00:20:27.914
No clue.

00:20:27.915 --> 00:20:30.626
Okay. Thanks. Bye.

00:20:32.044 --> 00:20:34.379
What? Hey, wait! What?

00:20:34.380 --> 00:20:35.506
Stop it!

00:20:37.341 --> 00:20:38.467
What?

00:20:39.677 --> 00:20:41.511
Wait, stop!

00:20:50.813 --> 00:20:52.481
Ah!

00:20:58.946 --> 00:21:02.908
Ah! No! Somebody!

00:21:03.826 --> 00:21:04.994
Ah!
:cue

00:21:06.287 --> 00:21:08.539
Do you want people to see this?

00:21:19.675 --> 00:21:21.801
LIBRARY - CLOSED

00:21:23.804 --> 00:21:27.432
Hey, wait!

00:21:27.433 --> 00:21:29.476
Wait!

00:21:37.276 --> 00:21:40.404
Hey, wait! Stop!

00:21:51.457 --> 00:21:53.167
This...

00:21:53.918 --> 00:21:56.587
is your true self. Isn't it, Kasuga?

00:22:00.799 --> 00:22:01.800
Fine.

00:22:02.509 --> 00:22:04.970
I won't tell anyone.

00:22:06.472 --> 00:22:07.556
Because, Kasuga,

00:22:08.057 --> 00:22:09.683
you're special.

00:22:11.560 --> 00:22:12.811
Special?

00:22:15.272 --> 00:22:16.941
In return...

00:22:20.152 --> 00:22:21.320
I want you...

00:22:22.821 --> 00:22:24.782
to make a contract with me.

00:22:25.491 --> 00:22:26.617
What?

00:22:30.287 --> 00:22:31.747
A contract?

00:22:48.514 --> 00:22:50.932
TO BE CONTINUED

00:23:47.990 --> 00:23:49.073
ON THE NEXT EPISODE

00:23:49.074 --> 00:23:51.909
Kasuga agrees
to a mysterious contract.

00:23:51.910 --> 00:23:53.244
Through a twist of fate,

00:23:53.245 --> 00:23:55.789
he manages to score
a date with Saeki, but...

00:23:56.540 --> 00:23:58.166
Next time, on episode two.

00:23:58.167 --> 00:24:01.169
The contract with Nakamura
weighs heavily on Kasuga.

00:24:01.170 --> 00:24:02.921
Translated by Yuka Kristi